                "value": "A picture of some <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euro_banknotes\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Euro banknotes\">Euro banknotes</a> and various <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euro_coins\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Euro coins\">Euro coins</a>.",
